2 CONT Born at Aursland Gard (farm).  In the (written) curture history for Tysvær , "Slik levde dei" ("The Way They Lived"), for the years 1820-1920, it is told about how the old family (long family lines) at Aursland left the farm to th
2 CONC e benefit of America and Haugesund (pages 263-266).  The two brothers Erik and Nil(s) Nilssøner, both descendants of Ibvar Halvardsson and Inga Torbjørnsdotter, sold their parts (of the Aursland farm) to strangers in 1836 and 1858
2 CONC .
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: Øritsland is synonymous with Aursland.
