1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Tysvær Gard og ætt 3 page 171 Skeiseid (10).
2 CONT
2 CONT Kristoffer og Anna bodde på Skeiseid i 1820 årene, de tre eldtste barna er født der.
2 CONT
2 CONT I 1865 bodde Kristoffer hos datteren Astrid og hennes familie i Haugesund.
2 CONT
2 CONT To America.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/126583471/christopher_christian-thompson
2 CONT
2 CONT Kristoffer (85), father of Christopher Christian Thompson or Kristoffer Kristoffersen, is living with his son Osmund(37) and Johanna C (33) and their children Mary (12), Martha (10), Anna (4), and Christopher (3) in 1880.
2 CONT
2 CONT Osmund, wife Johanna and two children, Christopher & Noah are buried at "Little Indian Creek Cemetery" at Leland. I'm guessing at this point that Father Christopher is also buried at the same Cemetery. I also think more of the fam
2 CONC ily is buried at that Cemetery also. Lot numbers and names are given but change in other later readings of the Cemetery. I plan a trip this summer to Leland to find out more fact based Information on Father Christopher Christian T
2 CONC hompson.
