1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/40874091/wilhemina-chatrina-peterson
2 CONT
2 CONT Mina was born Wilhelmine Catherine Sem in Boroy, Moster, Norway the daughter of Hans Messel Sem and Christina Sophie Weltzin. She married Peter Nilsson Peterson in Norway on 23 June 1835. They had 6 children: Nels (Nils), Hans, Pe
2 CONC ter, Kristian (Sophus Chistian – Norwegian name), Anna Kristine & Andreas. Mina and Peter emigrated to New Norway Twp, Minnesota, USA in about 1872 to join their 3 surviving sons who had emigrated in 1856. Peter returned to Norway
2 CONC  to sell the farm but he became ill and died 25 January 1874. He was buried in Moster Church, Norway.
2 CONT Contributor: Brian (49867902)
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Suggested edit: She was born as "Wilhelmine Catharine Metzel Sem" in Bergen, Hordaland County, Norway. Her christening was held on June 14, 1807 in Nykirken, Bergen, Hordaland County, Norway. Later her family moved to Boroy, Moste
2 CONC r, Bømlo, Hordaland County, Norway.
2 CONT Contributor: Roger Fossum (48065627) • rofos@epost.no
