1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Monday June 1, 1953
2 CONT Winona Republican 
2 CONT
2 CONT Bennie Jermstad TAYLOR, Wis. (Special)-- Bennie Jermstad 77, farmer in the Town of Springfield, died at his home Friday evening. He had a stroke a month ago. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Services were held today at p.m. at the Taylor Lutheran Church, the Rev. B. J, Hallem officiating. Burial was at the Woodlawn Cemetery here. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Survivors include two brothers, Ole, Fargo, N. D., and Peter, La Crosse. and four sisters, Mrs. Anna Moe, Black River Falls; Mrs. Julius Horn, Minneapolis; Mrs. Clinton Veeder, Watertown, S. D., and Mrs Helen Hegg of Taylor. A bro
2 CONC ther Sam of Taylor and B Louise Oakland ofSuperior have died.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/179170033/bennie-jermstad Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jun 13 
