2 CONT
2 CONT AGE IS NO HANDICAP A peppy gentleman is Peter Jermstad, who just recently celebrated his 90th birthday at Hillview Home where he has lived for the past two years. Above, he takes careful aim as he pays the Hillview table his daily
2 CONC  visit. He has good eyesight and reads widely. Jermstad was born Feb 11, 1880 in Taylor. A laborer in La Crosse all of his adult life, he never married and has no living relatives in the area. About Hillview he  said “They sure do
2 CONC  feed real good."* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/179168789/peter-olaus-jermstad Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jun 13 2022, 21:24:41 UTC''
