1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Son of Ole Peterson Jermstad and Serena/Sarah (Brown) Jermstad
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Matilda Pederson, she Daughter of Martha and Otto Pederson 
2 CONT Her father died in 1895 and her mother remarried to Christ Johnson
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT On the 1920 Census living in Springfield, Jackson Co, WI with wife Matilda, sons Lawrence S, Merlin S and his parents Ole and Serena Jermstad who had been both born in Norway. 
2 CONT
2 CONT On the 1930 and 1940 Census living in Springfield Town, Jackson Co., WI with matilda and their children 
2 CONT 1, Lawrence S (1916-6 Oct 1971)
2 CONT 2. Merlin Seymour (1920-1992)
2 CONT 3. Victor Donald (1921-1998)
2 CONT 4. Myrtle Caroline Olson (1927-2001)
2 CONT and brother Bennie Jermstad.
