1 NOTE {geni:about_me} "Obituary Ranheim, Phillip J., M.D. Age 72, of Mpls., formerly of Chaska, passed away peacefully after a short struggle with cancer. Grew up in Moorhead, MN and attended Concordia College and the U of M Medical Sch
2 CONC ool. Served in the USAF in Vietnam. Completed his residency in Cardiology at the U of M. Was on staff at Park Nicollet Medical Center for 30 years. Survived by brother, Richard Ranheim, M.D. (Laurie) of Mansura, LA; sister, Margar
2 CONC et Friedberg (Jay) of Maple Grove; nephews and nieces, Beau, Todd, Susan, Jordan and Lindsey; other loving relatives and friends. Phil's greatest passion was helping others. He helped students through medical school, mentored musi
2 CONC cians and was active in supporting the disadvantaged overcome drug and alcohol abuse. Truly a great man."
