2 CONT
2 CONT Sever Julius Skutley BIRTH	1 May 1869 Jackson County, Wisconsin, USA DEATH	25 Mar 1949 (aged 79) Taylor, Jackson County, Wisconsin, USA BURIAL	 Woodlawn Cemetery Taylor, Jackson County, Wisconsin, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Andrew and Helga
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Martha Christianson in 1898
2 CONT
2 CONT The Blair Press April 7, 1949
2 CONT
2 CONT Funeral services were held March 30th at Taylor Lutheran Church for Sever Skutley who passed away March 25th at the age of 79. He was born May 1, 1869 in Springfield and spent his entire life in the Jackson County and Taylor area.
2 CONC  He married Martha Christianson May 14, 1898. She preceded him in death Sept 4, 1948. They had one son Albert Skutley of Mercer Island, WA and one granddaughter LaVonne Skutley of Portland. He was the youngest of four brothers and
2 CONC  three sisters who all preceded him in death. He was a life long member of Taylor Lutheran Church.
2 CONT
2 CONT Also available obit
2 CONT
2 CONT March 28, 1949 Winona Daily News Page 10
