2 CONT 298. Jakob Sjurson ROMSALAND (499) was born in 1677 in Romsaland, Tysvær, Rogaland, Norway. He died in Romsaland, Tysvær, Rogaland, Norway. After his first wife Marta Kristoffersdtr. died, he married second Ragilla Gunnarsdtr. (pr
2 CONC obably Romsaland). He was married to Marta (Marita?) Kristoffersdtr. ASKELAND NORDRE.
2 CONT
2 CONT 299. Marta (Marita?) Kristoffersdtr. ASKELAND NORDRE (500)(501) was born in Nordre Askeland, Tysvær, Rogaland, Norway. She was either the 3rd born Marita mentioned in 1711 or the 4th born Marta Helene ? Children were: 
2 CONT
2 CONT  i. Siri Jakobsdtr. ROMSALAND(502) was born in 1716 in Romsaland, Tysvær, Rogaland, Norway. She died in 1776. She married Jakob Sakariasson from Tveit of Nesheim in Vats (also see Vestrå 29 and Mekjeland i Sveio 8). 
2 CONT
2 CONT 149 ii. Anna Jacobsdtr. ROMSALAND. 
2 CONT
2 CONT  iii. Marta Jakobsdtr. ROMSALAND(503) was born in 1721 in Romsaland, Tysvær, Rogaland, Norway. 
2 CONT
2 CONT  iv. Sjur Jakobson ROMSALAND(504) (505) was born in 1722 in Romsaland, Tysvær, Rogaland, Norway. He died in 1778. He married Sissela Helgesdtr. from Mehus (see Mehus 18 & Brattestø 9). 
2 CONT
2 CONT  v. Kristoffer Jakobson ROMSALAND(506) was born in 1726 in Romsaland, Tysvær, Rogaland, Norway. He died in 1791 in Romsaland, Tysvær, Rogaland, Norway. He married Astrid Torgersdtr from Spåtveit in Vats. They had 10 children. 
2 CONT
2 CONT  vi. Ingeborg ROMSALAND(507) was born in 1728 in Romsaland, Tysvær, Rogaland, Norway. See Dagsland in Skjold I (14). 
2 CONT
2 CONT  vii. Ragnilla Jakobsdtr ROMSALAND(508) (509) was born in 1731 in Romsaland, Tysvær, Rogaland, Norway. She died in 1755 in Vårå, Tysvær, Rogaland, Norway. She was the first wife of Johannes Helgeson Vårå. After Ragnillaæs death, J
2 CONC ohannes married second ingeborg Nilsdtr from Finshus.
2 CONT
