1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Jacob moved from Skjold to Haugesund. In 1865 he emigrated to the United States. He worked first near Leland, Illinois. After his marriage, he and Astrianne moved to Benton County, Iowa, then, in 1869, to Clay Coun
2 CONC ty, Dakota Territory (now South Dakota), where they settled on the southwest quarter of section 33, Pleasant Valley Township.
