2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/110902589/gunder-swen-wike
2 CONT
2 CONT Gunder Swen Wike BIRTH	18 Jan 1844 Valestrand, Osterøy kommune, Hordaland fylke, Norway DEATH	4 Feb 1929 (aged 85) Story City, Story County, Iowa, USA BURIAL	 Story City Cemetery Story City, Story County, Iowa, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Gunder Wike, son of Sven Vike and Engeborg Gunderson, married (1) Bronla Karina Orsland/Aurland and (2) Bertha S. Viken, daughter of Endre/Andres Johanesen and Gunhilde Anfinson, on 8 October 1915 in Story City, Story County, Iowa
2 CONC .
2 CONT
2 CONT From Ames Daily Tribune February 4, 1929
2 CONT
2 CONT Gunder Wike Dies At Story City Today
2 CONT
2 CONT Tribune's County News Service STORY CITY, Feb. 4.--Gunder Wike, 85, died early this morning at the hospital here following a week's illness after a minor operation.
2 CONT
2 CONT He is survived by his widow and the following children, Mrs. George Larson, Pingree, N. D., Mrs. Magnus Miller, Story City, Sigvold Wike, Ames, Marcus Wike, Jewell, and Anton Wike, Ames. He also has one brother John Wike, living a
2 CONC t Eagle Grove.
2 CONT
2 CONT Born in Norway, he emigrated to the United States in 1866.
2 CONT
2 CONT No funeral arrangements have been made.
2 CONT
