1 NAME Jens Friedrich Undahl /Weltzin/
2 GIVN Jens Friedrich Undahl
2 _MARNM Weltzin
2 NICK Weltzien
2 NICK Jens Fredrik
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1793
2 PLAC Kambe br. 1-3
