2 CONT BLOMENDAAL / BLUMENDAHL / BLOMENDAHL, Johannes, Weltzin / Welzin in Brandenburg, 1738 ?	http://forums.skadi.net/showthread.php?t=131696			
2 CONT
2 CONT Came to Norway as a officer in the army from Brandenburg.  Said to be from some where around or in Brandenburg.  Some places said to be born somehwere in Mechlenburg.  He and his family in Norway is in common sources said to be of
2 CONC  nobel German family but not proved nobel in Norway.  All his childern are married into rich and nobel families in Norway and Denmark and his boys became soldiers as himself.  Until know we have not found the connection to the Ger
2 CONC man nobel Weltzin/Weltzien, but all his boys have the same first names as used in that family.  
