1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Kvinnherad Gards- og ættesoga 5 page 300 Fatland (1f).Gards- og ættesoge for Sveio II page 191 Rygmyr (Rødmyr) (9), Kvinnherad Gards- og ættesoga 5 page 300 Fatland (2).
2 CONT
2 CONT Hans Olsen and Ingeborg lived at the northern part of Fatland
2 CONT
2 CONT census in 1801: http://digitalarkivet.arkivverket.no/en-gb/ft/bosted_land/bf01058370002415
2 CONT
2 CONT from Kvinnherad bygdesoga Author: Vaage, Erling, 1917-; Havnelid, Anders, 1929- p 300 item 1f and  2
2 CONT
2 CONT "Hans Olsson, 1740-1830, married Lisbet Jansdatter, 1742-1782, took over the farm from his father in 1762. In 1791 he married Ingeborg Pedersdatter Kjellesvik, 1742-1823. Ingeborg descended from grandfather and grandmother Captain
2 CONC  Peter LillienSkiold and Dorthea Bagger." Children by Lisbet were: A Anna, 1764-, b Severina, 1765-, c Ola, 1768-, d Erik, 1769-. Children by Lisbet [typo must be Ingeborg] were: e Peder LillienSkiold  f Ola, cotter married Siri O
2 CONC lsdotter, with son Ola, b. 1833.
2 CONT
2 CONT After Hans Olsson the farm was  divided between the two youngest sons, Ola and Peter, with one half each.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Kan Anna Hansdtr. (1235) vera dattera??
