1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/69002501/andrew-peterson-grindheim
2 CONT
2 CONT Andrew Peterson Grindheim was born to Peder and Mari Peterson on April 25, 1873 in Norway Lake, MN. He married Martha Westvig on May 25, 1895 in Belgrade, MN. They moved to North Dakota in May 1898 and homesteaded 2 miles West and
2 CONC  6 miles South of Bowdon, ND. Their entire farm was lost in a prairie fire in April 1925.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children born to Andrew and Martha were daughters Mollie and Pearl, and sons Minard and Walter.
