2 CONT
2 CONT Andrew K Skutley BIRTH	1 Jan 1885 Hixton, Jackson County, Wisconsin, USA DEATH	12 Jul 1973 (aged 88) Black River Falls, Jackson County, Wisconsin, USA BURIAL	 Sechlerville Cemetery Hixton, Jackson County, Wisconsin, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Andrew K. Skutley, 88, of Route 1 Hixton died at Black River Memorial Hospital July 12. He was born in Jackson County in the Curran Valley area January 1, 1885, to Mr. and Mrs. Knute Skutley. He owned and operated the Skutley Mill
2 CONC  in sechlerville before his retirement. Survivors include a son, Richard L., Eau Claire; two daughters, Mrs. Genevieve Rasmussen, Eau Claire, Mrs. E. Guy Cutshall, Hixton; one brother, Nels, Eau Claire; one sister, Mrs. Belle Olso
2 CONC n, Minneapolis; three grandchildren and five great grandchildren. Services wee conducted from the United Methodist Church, Hixton on Sunday with Rev. Calvin Carey officiating. Burial was in Sechlerville Cemetery. The Jensen Funera
2 CONC l Home, Hixton was in charge of arrangements. Obituary found in the Banner Journal, Black River Falls, WI, July 18, 1973.
