1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/155646996/serine-mitchell
2 CONT
2 CONT Leader-Telegram
2 CONT Eau Claire, Wisconsin
2 CONT 31 May 1983, Tue • Page 4
2 CONT
2 CONT Mrs Serine Mitchell, 94, Taylor, died Sunday May 29, at the Pine View Nursing Home in BRF.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was born in Curran Valley, May 5, 1889 to John and Mathea (Hanson) Tjeranson. She Married Nels A Skutley in 1917. He died in 1930.
2 CONT She Married Frank L Mitchell in 1930. They farmed in Curran Valley until his death.
2 CONT A half sister Inga, Mrs Erick Hedberg died in 1932.
2 CONT
2 CONT Survived by two daughters:
2 CONT 1. Elsa Madelyn (Ray) Sather (1924-2015)
2 CONT Daughter Elaine M Pregent
2 CONT 2. Helga Marthea (Oscar) Lindbo 1920-2003 Black River Falls
2 CONT Children: David, James, Ruth, Ann
2 CONT A son
2 CONT 3. Arvid Joel Skutley (1918-2000) in Ephrata, Washington state
2 CONT Married Emily, children Joel E and Raymond W
2 CONT
2 CONT Funeral will be Friday June 3, from the Taylor Lutheran Church, with Rev Omer Nelson officiating. Burial in Woodlawn cemetery at Taylor.
