1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Kristoffer bodde på Nordre Askeland, bruk A i 1791 og 1711. Siste året hadde de Ingeborg Ellevsdatter som "gjedetøs", hun fikk tre ort  i årslønn. I 1701 hadde de Tore Hansen 16 år fra Skjold som tjener.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Kilder 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1)  Tysvær. Gard og Ætt 1 
2 CONT
2 CONT 598. Kristoffer Larsen ASKELAND NORDRE(641) was born in 1655 in Nordre Askeland, Tysvær, Rogaland, Norway. He died before 1718. He and his family lived in North Askeland in 1701 and 1711. In 1701 had they Tore Hansen, 16 years old
2 CONC , from Skjold who was a servant. Kristoffer might also have lived on the Apeland farm. He and Anna had 4 children: Lars 1692 who took over the farm, Torger who was mentioned in 1711, Marita who was also mentioned in 1711, and "Mar
2 CONC ta Helene ?" He was married to Anna TORGERSDTR.
2 CONT
2 CONT 599. Anna TORGERSDTR (642). Children were: 
2 CONT
2 CONT  i. Lars Kristoffersen ASKELAND NORDRE(643) was born in 1692 in Nordre Askeland, Tysvær, Rogaland, Norway. He was born in 1692 in Nordre Askeland, Tysvær, Rogaland, Norway. He died before 1758. He took over the N. Askeland farm af
2 CONC ter his father. He had a son Kristoffer, b. 1719, who took over the farm from him. 
2 CONT
2 CONT  ii. Torger Kristoffersen ASKELAND NORDRE(644) . Mentioned in 1711. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 299 iii. Marta (Marita?) Kristoffersdtr. ASKELAND NORDRE. 
2 CONT
2 CONT  iv. (second daughter) ASKELAND NORDRE(645) was born in Nordre Askeland, Tysvær, Rogaland, Norway.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.familysearch.org/tree/person/details/LR4V-Z6L FamilySearch Genealogy] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Mar 13 2018, 23:48:52 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Gift med Anna Torgersdatter. De bodde på Nordre Askeland, Tysvær, Rogaland. Er nevnt her i 1701 og 1711. Da eldstesønnen, Lars, giftet seg ca. 1717 fikk han overta Nordre Askeland. De flyttet da med de yngste barna til Søre Vågepå
2 CONC  Austre Bokn. (Tysvær sokn. Gard og ætt, 1. s. 169.) (Ætt og heim 2005: Slekta på Nordre Askeland. s. 108.)
