1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Lars and Anne had two children, Thomas and Frances. Thomas was born in Norway about 1846 and Francis was born in Chicago Feb 1852. Anne remarried Torger Samuelson. Thomas and Frances were adopted. Frances is buried
2 CONC  in Freeborn County Minnesota. I don’t know what happened to Thomas. He was 14 years old in the 1860 Iowa census. Torger and Anne lived in Iowa and Hannaford, Minnesota.
