1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/106817089/evelyn-grace-durby
2 CONT
2 CONT Evelyn Grace Wike Durby BIRTH	7 Mar 1912 Hamilton County, Iowa, USA DEATH	16 Oct 1972 (aged 60) Story County, Iowa, USA BURIAL	 Story City Cemetery Story City, Story County, Iowa, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT From Ames Daily Tribune November 13, 1972
2 CONT
2 CONT Obituaries
2 CONT
2 CONT MRS. EVELYN DURBY
2 CONT
2 CONT Funeral services for Mrs. Evelyn Durby, 60, Story City, were held Oct. 19 frm Bethel Lutheran Church with the Rev. William A. Gregerson officiating. Also participating in the service was the Rev. Richard Sansgaard of Reeder, N.D. 
2 CONC Burial was in the Story City cemetery.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mrs. Durby died Oct 16 enroute to the Mary Greeley Hospital after suffering a heat attack at her home.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was born March 7, 1912, in Hamilton County, the daughter of Mr. and Mrs. Marcus Wike. She married Archie Durby, Sept. 17, 1936. They farmed near Nevada and Shipley and later moved to a farm, seven miles northwest of Story City
2 CONC . After the death of her husband in 1969, Mrs. Durby moved to Story City.
2 CONT
2 CONT Survivors include two daughters, Mrs. Delores Mackey, Story City and Mrs. Marjorie Gunderson, Phoenix, Ariz.; a son Mark, Story City; two sisters, Mrs. Ruby Weltha, Randall and Mrs. Blanche Templer, Jewell and two grandchildren.
2 CONT
2 CONT Pallbearers were Ernest Sansgaard, Gaylord Weltha, Melbourne Swenson, Dwight Larson, Sanford Duea and Bruce Templer.
2 CONT
