2 CONT Omen Domersness Enderson
2 CONT BIRTH	1857
2 CONT Vikebygd, Ullensvang kommune, Hordaland fylke, Norway
2 CONT DEATH	10 Oct 1926 (aged 68–69)
2 CONT Webster City, Hamilton County, Iowa, USA
2 CONT BURIAL	
2 CONT Story City Cemetery
2 CONT Story City, Story County, Iowa, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT From Nevada Evening Journal October 15, 1926 (page 4)
2 CONT
2 CONT Omen Enderson died Sunday afternoon at the Mercy hospital in Webster City. He had been in the hospital for about two weeks, where he underwent an operation for kidney trouble a few days before his death. Funeral services will be h
2 CONC eld Wednesday afternoon in the Bethel church. Mr. Enderson leaves his wife and several children. The Enderson family moved here a few years ago from a farm northwest of town.
